      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "加入了盐石宝的盐，\n味道浓厚的盐石宝咖啡……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "52A051654E8676D077F35B9D768476D0FF0C000A547390536D53539A768476D077F35B9D549655612026202600100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我试着煮了一下，\n不只咸，还咸过头了……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n还是当成隐藏菜单算了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118BD57740716E4E864E004E0BFF0C000A4E0D53EA54B8FF0C8FD854B88FC759344E862026202600100001BE00000A8FD8662F5F536210969085CF83DC53557B974E86300200100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "口味上的喜好果然因人而异啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53E354734E0A7684559C597D679C713656E04EBA800C5F02554A300200100002011401C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但多亏了你这位训练家的帮忙，\n我才找到了咖啡变咸的原因，真是太好了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46591A4E8F4E864F608FD94F4D8BAD7EC35BB676845E2E5FD9FF0C000A6211624D627E52304E865496556153D854B87684539F56E0FF0C771F662F592A597D4E86300200100002011401C00000",
